@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam ArrowColor #355070
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 16
  BorderColor #355070
  FontColor #1F2933
}
top to bottom direction

rectangle "1. Visual design   \n   mfd_editor" as Step1 #D9EDFF
rectangle "2. Sources author   \n   assets/windows   \n   assets/pages   \n   assets/reticles" as Step2 #E9F5DB
rectangle "3. Generation API   \n   client_api_generate_ui()   \n   + generate_ui.py" as Step3 #FFF3D6
rectangle "4. Generated artifacts   \n   MockupUi.h / MockupUi.cpp   \n   <window>.generated.map" as Step4 #FFF7B3
rectangle "5. Build client C++17   \n   mfd: :client + mfd::io_json" as Step5 #FFE5EC
rectangle "6. Execution runtime   \n   mfd_window --window ..." as Step6 #FFE3E3
rectangle "7. Live loop   \n   CommandClient / LatestBatchPublisher   \n   optional feedback" as Step7 #F3E8FF
rectangle "8. Optional capture   \n   direct callback or DLL plugin" as Step8 #FDE2E4

Step1 --> Step2 : sauvegarde
Step2 --> Step3 : parse the window
Step3 --> Step4 : emission coherente
Step4 --> Step5 : compilation / inclusion
Step2 --> Step6 : JSON loading
Step5 --> Step7 : business logic
Step7 --> Step6 : UDP commands
Step6 --> Step7 : feedback runtime
Step6 --> Step8 : framebuffer RGBA32

note right of Step4
Transport IDs and Hash mapping
come from the same author model.
end note
@enduml
